                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1118800                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  LÄSER W11187 (INDIREKT W91042) SAMT NOTERINGSFIL      *        
*                (W01162) SAMT SKAPAR UTLISTA "LISTING NEW PARTS"      *        
*                UPP TILL 10 VECKOR FRAMÅT                             *        
*                                                                      *        
*                OBSERVERA ATT IN-FLERS FRÅN W11187 INTE LÄNGRE        *        
*                INNEHÅLLER J/N UTAN */V/M ISTÄLLET !                  *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  JOHAN LINDKVIST                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  ÄNDRING    :                                                        *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVDELNING                   *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*     ......      ..................       ......                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
FILE W11188D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W01162  'NOT-'                                                                 
                                                                                
*FILE VIRTUAL1 FB(46 4600) VIRTUAL                                              
FILE VIRTUAL1 FB(46 0) VIRTUAL                                                  
%W01162  'SEL-'                                                                 
                                                                                
FILE W11188D2                                                                   
%W11187  'IN-'                                                                  
                                                                                
FILE W11188D3  PRINTER FB (133 0)                                               
                                                                                
FILE W11188D4  PRINTER VB (137 0)                                               
                                                                                
***** WORKING STORAGE AREA *** ARBETSFÄLT ****                                  
WS-RUBRIK-DC      W                21 A                                         
WS-IDDC           W                2  A                                         
JA                W                1  A  VALUE 'J'                              
                                                                                
WS-TIAAVV-SLUT    W                3  P                                         
                                                                                
INNEV-AAVV        W                4  N                                         
INNEV-AA          INNEV-AAVV       2  N                                         
INNEV-VV          INNEV-AAVV  +2   2  N                                         
                                                                                
***** WORKING STORAGE AREA *** FIXFÄLT *******                                  
WS-IDFKNGRP       W   4   N   MASK 'ZZZ9'                                       
W-SUP             W   1   A                                                     
WS-IDARTNR        W   8   N   MASK 'ZZZZZZZ9'                                   
WS-TIFINLV        W   4   N                                                     
WS-IDARTNR-JFR    W   8   N   MASK 'ZZZZZZZZ'                                   
NOTERING          W   40  A                                                     
NOTERING-7        W   40  A                                                     
W-BLANK           W   91  A                                                     
WS-KDUART         W   1   A                                                     
WS-FLLSRDEL       W   1   A                                                     
WS-PRARTSTD       W   1   A                                                     
*    --- VALID IDDC CODES                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
***** ALLMÄNNA SUBPROGRAM ********************                                  
W009VADD          W   8   A   VALUE 'W009VADD'                                  
WS-ANTAL-VECKOR   W   2   P  0                                                  
                                                                                
PROGRAM-NAMN      W   6   A   VALUE 'W01188'                                    
DATUMKORT-ID      W   6   A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                    
%WDATKORT 'DATKORT-'                                                            
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. LÄSER NOTERINGSFIL                                                    
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11188D1) +                                                          
    NAME STEP1                                                                  
                                                                                
  IF NOT-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3.  * 3 = BEREDNING                                     
    PUT VIRTUAL1 FROM W11188D1                                                  
  END-IF                                                                        
  IF NOT-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7.  * 7 = BEREDNING                                     
    PUT VIRTUAL1 FROM W11188D1                                                  
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
* STEG 2. MATCHAR NOTERINGSFILEN MED W11187 OCH SKAPAR LISTA                    
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11188D2 KEY(IN-IDARTNR) +                                           
           VIRTUAL1 KEY(SEL-NOT-IDARTNR)) +                                     
              START (A-INIT)                                                    
IF MATCHED                                                                      
                                                                                
  IF IN-KDERS = 0                                                               
     IF DUPLICATE VIRTUAL1                                                      
        IF FIRST-DUP VIRTUAL1                                                   
          IF IN-KDUART NQ 'P'                                                   
            WS-KDUART = ' '                                                     
          ELSE                                                                  
            WS-KDUART = IN-KDUART.          * 'P', MED ANDRA ORD                
          END-IF                                                                
                                                                                
          IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                               
             NOTERING   =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                     
          END-IF                                                                
          IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                               
             NOTERING-7 =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                     
          END-IF                                                                
          W-SUP    =  IN-FLERS                                                  
                                                                                
          IF IN-FLLSRDEL = 'J'                                                  
            WS-FLLSRDEL  = 'Y'                                                  
          ELSE                                                                  
            WS-FLLSRDEL  = ' '                                                  
          END-IF                                                                
          IF IN-PRARTSTD = 0                                                    
            WS-PRARTSTD  = 'N'                                                  
          ELSE                                                                  
            WS-PRARTSTD  = ' '                                                  
          END-IF                                                                
          PERFORM B-TILLDELNING                                                 
       ELSE                                                                     
          IF LAST-DUP VIRTUAL1                                                  
            IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                             
               NOTERING   =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                   
            END-IF                                                              
            IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                             
               NOTERING-7 =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                   
            END-IF                                                              
            PERFORM C-PRINT                                                     
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
   ELSE                                                                         
       IF IN-KDUART NQ 'P'                                                      
          WS-KDUART = ' '                                                       
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-KDUART = IN-KDUART.          * 'P', MED ANDRA ORD                  
       END-IF                                                                   
                                                                                
       MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING                                                   
       MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING-7                                                 
       IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 3                                                  
          NOTERING   =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
       IF SEL-NOT-KDNOTTYP = 7                                                  
          NOTERING-7 =  SEL-NOT-TEARTNOT                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
                                                                                
       W-SUP    =  IN-FLERS                                                     
       IF IN-FLLSRDEL = 'J'                                                     
         WS-FLLSRDEL  = 'Y'                                                     
       ELSE                                                                     
         WS-FLLSRDEL  = ' '                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       IF IN-PRARTSTD = 0                                                       
         WS-PRARTSTD  = 'N'                                                     
       ELSE                                                                     
         WS-PRARTSTD  = ' '                                                     
       END-IF                                                                   
       PERFORM B-TILLDELNING                                                    
       PERFORM C-PRINT                                                          
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
ELSE                                                                            
  IF W11188D2                                                                   
    IF IN-KDERS-UTG = 0                                                         
      IF IN-KDERS = 0                                                           
        MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING                                                  
        MOVE SPACE TO NOTERING-7                                                
                                                                                
        W-SUP = IN-FLERS                                                        
                                                                                
        IF IN-FLLSRDEL = 'J'                                                    
          WS-FLLSRDEL = 'Y'                                                     
        ELSE                                                                    
          WS-FLLSRDEL = ' '                                                     
        END-IF                                                                  
        IF IN-PRARTSTD = 0                                                      
          WS-PRARTSTD = 'N'                                                     
        ELSE                                                                    
          WS-PRARTSTD = ' '                                                     
        END-IF                                                                  
        WS-KDUART = IN-KDUART.         * 'P', MED ANDRA ORD                     
        PERFORM B-TILLDELNING                                                   
        PERFORM C-PRINT                                                         
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT  USING (PROGRAM-NAMN +                                           
                       DATUMKORT-ID +                                           
                       DATKORT-DATUMKORT)                                       
  INNEV-AA      = DATKORT-D-AAR                                                 
  INNEV-VV      = DATKORT-D-VECKA                                               
                                                                                
  WS-TIAAVV-SLUT  = INNEV-AAVV                                                  
  WS-ANTAL-VECKOR = 10                                                          
  CALL W009VADD USING (WS-TIAAVV-SLUT  WS-ANTAL-VECKOR)                         
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
B-TILLDELNING. PROC                                                             
  WS-TIFINLV      =  IN-TIFINLV / 10                                            
  WS-IDARTNR      =  IN-IDARTNR                                                 
  WS-IDFKNGRP     =  IN-IDFKNGRP                                                
  WS-IDARTNR-JFR  =  IN-IDARTNR-MOTSV                                           
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
C-PRINT. PROC                                                                   
  IF IN-FLJANEJ-US-CAN = JA                                                     
     WS-RUBRIK-DC = 'NORTH AMERICA (41-51)'                                     
     WS-IDDC      = 'NA'                                                        
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
     PRINT UTFIL                                                                
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  IF IN-FLJANEJ-JPN    = JA                                                     
     WS-RUBRIK-DC = 'JAPAN (61)'                                                
     WS-IDDC      = NDC-JP                                                      
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
  IF IN-FLJANEJ-AUS    = JA                                                     
     WS-RUBRIK-DC = 'AUSTRALIA (62)'                                            
     WS-IDDC      = NDC-AU                                                      
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
REPORT RAPPORT01 PRINTER W11188D3 LINESIZE 132 PAGESIZE 41 +                    
       NOADJUST NOSPREAD SPACE 1 TITLESKIP 3                                    
                                                                                
SEQUENCE WS-IDDC IN-KDPRODSL IN-IDFKNGRP IN-IDARTNR                             
CONTROL  WS-IDDC NEWPAGE RENUM NOPRINT                                          
                                                                                
TITLE 1  COL 12  'VOLVO CAR PARTS   W11188-001 '           +                    
         COL 48  'LISTING NEW PARTS, ' WS-RUBRIK-DC                             
                                                                                
TITLE 2  COL 48  'PUBL WEEK UP TO WEEK ' WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                         
                                                                                
HEADING IN-IDPROJ      ('PROJ')                                                 
HEADING WS-IDFKNGRP    ('FUNC' 'GRP')                                           
HEADING W-SUP          ('S' 'P')                                                
HEADING WS-IDARTNR     ('PART NO')                                              
HEADING IN-BEART-USA   ('DESCRIPTION')                                          
HEADING IN-KDPRODSL    ('PR' 'GRP')                                             
HEADING IN-KDPSLLOC    ('LOC' 'PR' 'GRP')                                       
HEADING IN-KDBPSR      ('B' 'P')                                                
HEADING WS-TIFINLV     ('PUBL' 'WEEK')                                          
HEADING WS-IDARTNR-JFR ('COMP' 'PART NO')                                       
HEADING WS-KDUART      ('P')                                                    
HEADING IN-KDFARLIG    ('D' 'G')                                                
HEADING WS-FLLSRDEL    ('DA' 'SP')                                              
HEADING WS-PRARTSTD    ('P' 'R')                                                
HEADING NOTERING       ('NOTES')                                                
                                                                                
LINE 01  IN-IDPROJ WS-IDFKNGRP W-SUP WS-IDARTNR IN-BEART-USA  +                 
         IN-KDPRODSL IN-KDPSLLOC IN-KDBPSR  WS-TIFINLV        +                 
         WS-IDARTNR-JFR WS-KDUART IN-KDFARLIG WS-FLLSRDEL     +                 
         WS-PRARTSTD NOTERING                                                   
LINE 02  W-BLANK NOTERING-7                                                     
***                                                                             
REPORT UTFIL PRINTER W11188D4 LINESIZE 132 PAGESIZE 41 +                        
       NOADJUST NOSPREAD SPACE 1 TITLESKIP 3                                    
                                                                                
SEQUENCE WS-IDDC IN-KDPRODSL IN-IDFKNGRP IN-IDARTNR                             
CONTROL  WS-IDDC NEWPAGE RENUM NOPRINT                                          
                                                                                
TITLE 1  COL 12  'VOLVO CAR PARTS   W11188-001 '           +                    
         COL 48  'LISTING NEW PARTS, ' WS-RUBRIK-DC                             
                                                                                
TITLE 2  COL 48  'PUBL WEEK UP TO WEEK ' WS-TIAAVV-SLUT                         
                                                                                
HEADING IN-IDPROJ      ('PROJ')                                                 
HEADING WS-IDFKNGRP    ('FUNC' 'GRP')                                           
HEADING W-SUP          ('S' 'P')                                                
HEADING WS-IDARTNR     ('PART NO')                                              
HEADING IN-BEART-USA   ('DESCRIPTION')                                          
HEADING IN-KDPRODSL    ('PR' 'GRP')                                             
HEADING IN-KDPSLLOC    ('LOC' 'PR' 'GRP')                                       
HEADING IN-KDBPSR      ('B' 'P')                                                
HEADING WS-TIFINLV     ('PUBL' 'WEEK')                                          
HEADING WS-IDARTNR-JFR ('COMP' 'PART NO')                                       
HEADING WS-KDUART      ('P')                                                    
HEADING IN-KDFARLIG    ('D' 'G')                                                
HEADING WS-FLLSRDEL    ('DA' 'SP')                                              
HEADING WS-PRARTSTD    ('P' 'R')                                                
HEADING NOTERING       ('NOTES')                                                
                                                                                
LINE 01  IN-IDPROJ WS-IDFKNGRP W-SUP WS-IDARTNR IN-BEART-USA  +                 
         IN-KDPRODSL IN-KDPSLLOC IN-KDBPSR  WS-TIFINLV        +                 
         WS-IDARTNR-JFR WS-KDUART IN-KDFARLIG WS-FLLSRDEL     +                 
         WS-PRARTSTD NOTERING                                                   
LINE 02  W-BLANK NOTERING-7                                                     
